      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini Robotics 2.5 accelerates real-world general dexterity",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are introducing Gemini Robotics 2.5, our most capable vision-language-action (VLA) model to date.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini Robotics 2.5 increases both the breadth of skills a robot can learn and the speed at which it can acquire them.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We tested Gemini Robotics 2.5’s capabilities in task breadth, performance, and complexity across over 200 distinct tasks, though this approach could scale to many more.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini Robotics 2.5 marks a leap forward in three key areas:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini Robotics 2.5 is rolling out to our robotics partners .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Gemini Robotics 2.5, we expanded the model capabilities in task breadth, performance, and complexity.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Using our embodied reasoning model ( Gemini Robotics ER ) to keep track of the workflow, and the Gemini Robotics 2.5 actions model to control its hands and arms, the robot reaches into supply bins, picks up metal automotive brackets, and places them into sequencing containers,…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Argon’s robotics research capabilities helped solve these bottlenecks by acting as a simulation engine, which greatly accelerated our development of Gemini Robotics 2.5.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:40.952Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Examples of Gemini 4 Argon’s robotics research capabilities accelerating Gemini Robotics 2.5",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-robotics-2-5-accelerates-real-world-physical-intelligence/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-09T19:51:47.000Z",
